<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?><ns2:section xmlns:ns2="http://rest.cis.illinois.edu" id="74257" href="https://courses.illinois.edu/cisapp/explorer/schedule/2025/spring/DANC/470/74257.xml"><parents><calendarYear id="2025" href="https://courses.illinois.edu/cisapp/explorer/schedule/2025.xml">2025</calendarYear><term id="120251" href="https://courses.illinois.edu/cisapp/explorer/schedule/2025/spring.xml">Spring 2025</term><subject id="DANC" href="https://courses.illinois.edu/cisapp/explorer/schedule/2025/spring/DANC.xml">Dance</subject><course id="470" href="https://courses.illinois.edu/cisapp/explorer/schedule/2025/spring/DANC/470.xml">Dancing in Community III &amp; IV</course></parents><sectionNumber>A  </sectionNumber><sectionTitle>Dancing in Community IV</sectionTitle><statusCode>A</statusCode><sectionText>DANC 470 – Dancing in Community IV is a progressive exploration of varied movement practices designed to support the major’s ability to ARTICULATE their technical and creative evolution. Students enrolled in DANC 360 and 460 should also enroll in DANC 470. This course is an exploration of varied movement practices that build community and ensemble approaches to dancing. To provide a balance of training from a range of cultural origins and traditions, this course will include a multitude of contemporary dance genres and styles.</sectionText><partOfTerm>1</partOfTerm><sectionStatusCode>A</sectionStatusCode><enrollmentStatus>Open</enrollmentStatus><startDate>2025-01-21Z</startDate><endDate>2025-05-07Z</endDate><meetings><meeting id="0"><type code="LAB">Laboratory</type><start>09:00 AM</start><end>10:30 AM</end><daysOfTheWeek>F      </daysOfTheWeek><roomNumber>2500</roomNumber><buildingName>Krannert Center for Perf Arts</buildingName><instructors><instructor lastName="Gonzalez" firstName="G">Gonzalez, G</instructor></instructors></meeting></meetings></ns2:section>